    narad_p:systemDescription "Magnet System (MAG): Controls beam trajectory and focusing in the storage ring. Includes dipole bending magnets, quadrupole focusing magnets, sextupole magnets for chromaticity correction, and corrector magnets for precise beam steering. All magnets are powered by regulated power supplies and are critical for maintaining stable beam orbit and beam quality." .

